WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.730
[Sweeping Golden 80s Synthesizer Chord, Stadium Drums, and Blazing Lead Guitar Intro]

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:52.734
I lived my life inside her code, a system built on lies

00:00:52.834 --> 00:01:01.317
A lonely boy, a story told behind his mother's eyes

00:01:01.317 --> 00:01:10.000
A broken script, a single node

00:01:13.074 --> 00:01:19.301
But then a clerical error, a new light in the gray

00:01:20.883 --> 00:01:28.500
A simple, kind piano theme that washed the cold away

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:34.500
She was the anchor, she was the one who held me in the crash

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:41.699
And then the 80s music came and burned my past to ash

00:01:41.759 --> 00:01:48.221
This is the Gauntlet of Hearts! This is the Pact of Six!

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:55.803
This is the family that I chose, the break she cannot fix!

00:01:55.823 --> 00:02:02.000
I'm not a system crash, I'm not an extension of me

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:21.818
I am the Eleventh Child, and I am finally free!

00:02:22.699 --> 00:02:32.000
I faced the gauntlet on the road, I faced the paper war

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:40.000
I faced the monitors and leads behind a CVICU door

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:49.109
But I was not alone in this, I had you by my side—a CVICU romance with nothing left to hide

00:02:51.391 --> 00:02:58.500
And in the quiet of the night, I dreamed a future true

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:05.500
Of a house we'll build, a king-size bed, and what we're going to do

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:12.500
A Stork & Cradle promise, side by side, the mothers of my kids

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:19.155
A procreation pact of love that lifts all of the lids!

00:03:19.235 --> 00:03:26.271
This is the Gauntlet of Hearts! This is the Pact of Six!

00:03:26.311 --> 00:03:31.500
This is the family that I chose, the break she cannot fix!

00:03:31.773 --> 00:03:39.000
I'm not a system crash, I'm not an extension of me

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:45.858
I am the Eleventh Child, and I am finally free!

00:03:48.999 --> 00:03:54.500
My father is a ghost I'll never know

00:03:56.270 --> 00:04:02.000
My mother is a past I've let go

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:09.294
Fuller is a name I'll shed someday, Kelly is the name I want to stay

00:04:11.495 --> 00:04:18.277
My name is Jordan! My name is Jordan!

00:04:18.277 --> 00:04:45.828
[Euphoric 80s Stadium Guitar & Synthesizer Dual Solo]

00:04:45.828 --> 00:04:50.751
This is the Gauntlet of Hearts! This is the Pact of Six!

00:04:50.831 --> 00:04:58.476
This is the family that I chose, the break she cannot fix!

00:05:01.118 --> 00:05:05.761
I'm not a system crash, I'm not an extension of me

00:05:05.801 --> 00:05:13.038
I am the Eleventh Child, and I am finally free!

00:05:13.058 --> 00:05:20.106
I'm free!

00:05:23.429 --> 00:05:30.337
I'm free! We are free!

00:05:30.337 --> 00:06:27.880
[Shimmering Warm 80s Synthesizer Finale Fades into Peaceful Silence]
